✅ Positive Test Cases
Verify that the Admin Management tab opens when clicked from the navigation bar.
Verify clicking on "+Add Role" redirects to the Add Role page.
Verify enabling the status toggle button activates the selected role.
Verify disabling the status toggle button deactivates the selected role.
Verify that roles are listed correctly in the Role column.
Verify clicking the Edit button opens the role editing interface.
Verify clicking the Delete button removes the role after confirmation.
Verify the role list changes based on selected row count (10, 20, 50, etc.).
Verify the Export button downloads admin data in the correct format.
Verify the Search field correctly filters admins by username, email, or name.
Verify the Date Range filter shows results based on selected date.
Verify selecting "Full Read Access" filters admins accordingly.
Verify selecting "Co-Admin" filters admins accordingly.
Verify the Status toggle correctly updates user status and reflects immediately.
Verify admin details such as Username, Full Name, Email, Mobile Number, and Last Login Time are displayed correctly.
Verify clicking Edit on an admin record opens the edit page with pre-filled data.
Verify Admin Logs page loads successfully with correct filters.
Verify search by Username in Admin Logs returns accurate results.
Verify filtering logs by Operation Type returns relevant actions.
Verify that IP Whitelisting page loads properly.
Verify adding a valid new IP works correctly.
Verify filtering IPs by type shows matching entries.
Verify pagination in Admin Logs and IP Whitelist works as expected.
Verify clicking "Cancel" in Add Role or Add IP pages redirects back correctly.
Verify the Add Role form accepts valid string input.

❌ Negative Test Cases

Verify the Admin Management tab does not load without an internet connection.
Verify Export button behavior when no data is available — should show a message or download an empty file.
Verify Search with special characters or unsupported symbols returns no results or error.
Verify selecting an invalid or reversed date range displays an error or no data.
Verify applying a Role filter that has no associated admins shows empty results.
Verify editing admin details without the proper permissions shows an access-denied message.
Verify activating/deactivating an admin while offline shows an appropriate error.
Verify manually entering a non-existent page number in pagination results in error or no data.
Verify selecting an unusually large row count causes no crash but may slow performance.
Verify system behavior when two admins have the same username/email — should show validation errors.
Verify searching for an invalid username in Admin Logs returns no results.
Verify selecting a future date range in Admin Logs returns no logs.
Verify applying an Operation Type filter with no matching logs shows empty state.
Verify loading Admin Logs without internet shows a connection error.
Verify viewing action logs with an expired session redirects to login.
Verify adding an IP with an invalid format (e.g., missing dots, too many segments).
Verify adding a duplicate IP address shows validation or duplication error.
Verify submitting Add IP form with missing required fields prevents submission.
Verify submitting empty IP Description or IP Address fields shows error.
Verify entering only numbers, special characters, or blank input in the Add Role form shows validation errors.
Verify clicking "Cancel" in Add Role or Add IP form doesn't save the data.
